cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ParsRAG in research or a publication, cite this software."
type: software
title: "ParsRAG"
abstract: >-
  ParsRAG is a bilingual, offline-first retrieval-augmented generation (RAG)
  workspace for chatting with Persian (Farsi) and English documents. Parsing,
  OCR, multilingual embeddings, LlamaIndex retrieval, and Qdrant vector search
  run locally; answers come from a local LLM through Ollama or an explicitly
  configured OpenAI-compatible endpoint, with cited sources.
keywords:
  - Persian
  - Farsi
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - RAG
  - document question answering
  - OCR
  - local LLM
  - Ollama
  - LlamaIndex
  - Qdrant
authors:
  - family-names: "Madani"
    given-names: "Pooria"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pooria82/ParsRAG"
